[h1]New offers in the Premium Shop[/h1]

[url=https://worldofwarplanes.com/news/paint-scheme-bundles-nov-2021/][img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33592511/af227d60ec04d5c4e5cf7e3a519ccb7808983095.png[/img][/url]
The Premium Shop offers you new bundles with  gold, and  paint schemes for the following aircraft:
[list][*]  Focke-Wulf Fw 56 Stosser;
[*]  Blohm und Voss Ha 137;
[*]  Arado Ar 197;
[*]  Messerschmitt Bf 110 C-6;
[*]  Polikarpov I-16 (late mod.);
[*]  Ilyushin BSh-2;
[*]  Messerschmitt Bf 109 B;
[*]  Heinkel He 112;
[*]  Polikarpov I-17;
[*]  Kochyerigin Sh (LBSh);
[*]  Messerschmitt Bf 110 B;
[*]  Focke-Wulf Fw 189 C Eule.[/list]
These unique decorations will help you dress up your aircraft in style as well as boost bonus characteristics (cruise speed: +3%).

[h1]November Deals[/h1]
[url=https://worldofwarplanes.com/news/november-deals-2021/][img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33592511/836eb5dc8b82a809c26960b29f237e69c23f119b.jpg[/img][/url]

Generous November Deals are available [b]till December 1 (03:20 PT / 06:20 ET)! [/b] Here you will find all the hottest bundles of the month! The Premium Shop will offer you stock of supply crates, gold and materials.

[h2][url=https://worldofwarplanes.com/news/november-deals-2021/]Check the article for more details![/url][/h2]

[h1]Tupolev Tu-1: Ready for battle[/h1]
[url=https://worldofwarplanes.com/news/tu-1-bundles-nov-2021/][img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33592511/485f5b92058347f5283a52f5501612a4ccad69d9.png[/img][/url]

Become the owner of the rare aircraft – the  Tupolev Tu-1! Survivability, four powerful autocannons, and a long-lasting boost make the Tu-1 an ideal hunter of both enemy bombers and attack aircraft!

In addition you will receive  a  personal battle mission on an experienced crew with free skill points!

Bundle is available for purchase till December 1 (03:20 PT / 06:20 ET).
